=== HLPWDG page 1
| Help                            Widgets - Help                                 |
|                                                                                |
|     The Work with Widgets panel lists the widgets of a library and lets        |
|     you change, remove, show and describe them. Type an option next to         |
|     an entry and press Enter; the option runs for every entry you              |
|     marked, in the order of the list.                                          |
|                                                                                |
| How to pick an entry                                                           |
|                                                                                |
|     Type the option number in the Opt column of the entry. To run the          |
|     same option for several entries, type it next to each of them. The         |
|     cursor's entry is GADGET when nothing is typed.                            |
|                                                                                |
|     To run a command instead, type it on the command line and press            |
|     Enter.  For help on a command, type its name and press F4 (Prompt).        |
|                                                                                |
| Options                                                                        |
|                                                                                |
|     o Change: the change panel for the entry.                                  |
|                                                                                |
|                                                                        More... |
| F3=Exit help   F10=Move to top   F12=Cancel   F13=Information Assistant        |
| F14=Print help                                                                 |
|                                                                                |
cursor: None
more: Some(More { row: 21, col: 73, bottom: false })
blue: 1,2 22,2 22,17 22,35 22,48 23,2
bright: 1,34 8,2 17,2 21,73
=== HLPWDG page 2
| Help                            Widgets - Help                                 |
|                                                                                |
|     o Remove: the entry is removed after you confirm.                          |
|                                                                                |
|     o Show: the display panel for the entry.                                   |
|                                                                                |
| Keys                                                                           |
|                                                                                |
|     F5        Refreshes the list from the library.                             |
|                                                                                |
|     F11       Shows the quantities instead of the text.                        |
|                                                                                |
|     Note: Options you type stay on the panel until they run.                   |
|                                                                                |
| Examples                                                                       |
|                                                                                |
|       2  GADGET     QGPL                                                       |
|       4  SPROCKET   QGPL                                                       |
|                                                                                |
|     Marking two entries runs both options when you press Enter. See more       |
|                                                                        More... |
| F3=Exit help   F10=Move to top   F12=Cancel   F13=Information Assistant        |
| F14=Print help                                                                 |
|                                                                                |
